   "install": {
    "title": "Installation",
    "html": "<p>Clone the repo:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">git clone https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.2.git\ncd Wan2.2\n</code></pre>\n<p>Install dependencies:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\"># Ensure torch &gt;= 2.4.0\n# If the installation of `flash_attn` fails, try installing the other packages first and install `flash_attn` last\npip install -r requirements.txt\n# If you want to use CosyVoice to synthesize speech for Speech-to-Video Generation, please install requirements_s2v.txt additionally\npip install -r requirements_s2v.txt\n</code></pre>",
